    tips:['Do Corbettmaths 5-a-day every revision day - 10 minutes keeps everything fresh.','Learn which formula to use for each topic - many marks are lost from wrong formula choice.','Attempt past paper questions before watching solutions. Struggling first means better memory.','Check mark schemes carefully - maths gives method marks even when the final answer is wrong.','Higher topics that always appear: quadratics, simultaneous equations, trigonometry, circle theorems.']},
  english:{name:'English Lit and Lang',emoji:'&#128214;',board:'AQA',bg:'var(--eng-bg)',t:'var(--eng-t)',
